{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的话句与感受交替出现，部分段落静态短词较多，扫读不如Y的左右分栏顺畅，尤其S01和S05。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更容易快速定位，但X用【】突出每段的心理关键点，又用随音乐出现的感受细化情绪变化，实际听读时能得到更多层次。尤其X保留了几处重要的心理递进：想靠近却怕要得太多、意识到可能互相依靠时的隐约紧张，以及愿意陪伴与害怕失去之间的矛盾，这些让人物动机和整段故事更完整。Y读起来更顺，却把部分细微的心理转折压缩掉了，感受描写也相对概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9442f933-f274-4cb1-bd03-60a3bd74f7aa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052625604244Z", "elapsed_seconds": 132.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:28:38.603085+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "763dbe8bf72f3fe94433747c11344532f70d87f38512cb12eff65291626894e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment